<BaseLayout title="About this reference">
  <h1>About this reference</h1>
  <p>The purpose of this site is to make ownership information easier to find than it is in scattered notes, forum posts, and generic parts listings.</p>
  <h2>How to use it</h2>
  <p>Use the navigation on the left to browse by vehicle system or task. Repair pages should list required tools, preparation, steps, checks, and any known differences between configurations.</p>
  <h2>Information quality</h2>
  <p>Where possible, technical claims should be tied to an official Volvo source, a part manufacturer's documentation, or a clearly identified owner observation. Unverified information should be labeled as such.</p>
  <div class="note">This site is not a substitute for the owner's manual, workshop information, professional diagnosis, or safe repair practices.</div>
</BaseLayout>
